Z||000000||AusFiero||12-23-2001||07:02 AM||||Well here I go again. To the tune of Rudolph the Red Nose Reindeer.<P>Rudolph the red-nosed reindeer, had a very shiny car.<BR>And if you ever saw it, you would even say ooo ahh.<BR>All of the other reindeer, used to laugh and call him names.<BR>They never let poor Rudolph, drag against their dud Mustangs.<BR>Then one foggy Christmas eve Santa came to say,<BR>Rudolph with your Fiero so bright,<BR>Won't you race the guys tonight?<BR>Then all the reindeer cringed and shuddered with no glee.<BR>Rudolph the red-nosed reindeer, blew away the Mustang team.<P>Ok, not so good but hey. I said I was bored earlier.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/auschristmas.gif">        <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
